  "notes": [
    "Compile-only samples execute canonical CMake compile_commands.json commands; only object output paths are redirected. Each compiler uses its own PCH.",
    "Three runs with alternating compiler order. The benchmark launches one compiler process at a time; host background load and CPU frequency are not controlled.",
    "The installed GCC driver injects fortify, stack protection, stack-clash, control-flow protection and zero-init-padding flags which the installed Clang driver does not. Results compare these installed toolchains, not identical implicit defaults.",
    "Game edit samples append different comments to force compilation with the compiler cache disabled. Original source restored afterwards.",
    "The game edit comparison includes linking and is separately paired; do not combine its absolute timings with the earlier build_times_2026-11-06.json runs.",
    "Runtime spot checks measure single-core CPU kernels, including a NullBackend sprite collection case, not GPU rendering or whole-game FPS.",
    "No like-for-like full clean-build timing comparison, full 3D runtime suite, or Windows validation was performed."
  ]
